Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 10:16:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add UI shell: navigation and placeholder pages for CareerIQ

- Replace default Blazor branding/demo content (Hello world, About link, purple sidebar)
- Remove Counter and Weather example pages
- Add Home, Student Profile, Career Assessment, Recommendations,
  Learning Roadmap, Recommendation History pages
- Add responsive nav with active link states (desktop sidebar / mobile collapsible)
- Add reusable PlaceholderNotice component; unfinished pages clearly marked
- No fake AI recommendation data, no DB or ML.NET wiring
- Scoped entirely to src/CareerAdvisor.Web
